## Error Title
Health Check Timeout

---

## Error ID
KE-HEALTH-001

---

## Error Description
Failed health check: timeout

---

## Root Cause
A dependent service or infrastructure monitor did not respond before the configured timeout period. This can be caused by slow network connectivity, overloaded service instances, or temporary service downtime.

---

## Resolution
- Verify the health-check endpoint and network connectivity.
- Check the target service logs for slow responses or resource exhaustion.
- Increase the health-check timeout if the service legitimately needs more time to respond.
- Restart or scale the affected service if it is overloaded.

